# Device Tree for Redmi 9T / 9 Power / Note 9 4G (lime) and POCO M3 (citrus)

Copyright (C) 2023 The LineageOS Project

> **Before building:** Edit `packages/apps/Settings/res/values/lunaris_strings.xml` to set the About phone information for your build.

## Maintainer Tag inside `system.prop` or `product.prop`

`ro.lunaris.maintainer=GHOST | ゴースト`

## About the devices

- **Redmi 9T / 9 Power / Note 9 4G:** A budget smartphone series from Redmi, released January 18, 2021.
- **POCO M3:** A budget smartphone from POCO, released November 24, 2020.

## Specifications

| Component       | Details |
|-----------------|---------|
| OS              | Android 10 (MIUI 12), upgradeable to Android 12 (MIUI 14.0) |
| CPU             | Octa-core: 4x2.0 GHz Kryo 260 Gold + 4x1.8 GHz Kryo 260 Silver |
| Chipset         | Qualcomm SM6115 Snapdragon 662 (11 nm) |
| GPU             | Adreno 610 |
| Memory          | 64 GB / 4 GB RAM, 128 GB / 4 GB RAM, 128 GB / 6 GB RAM |
| microSD         | microSDXC (dedicated slot) |
| Battery         | 6000 mAh Li-Po, non-removable |
| Display         | 1080 x 2340 px, 19.5:9, ~395 ppi |
| Rear cameras    | 48 MP f/1.8 (wide, PDAF); 8 MP f/2.2 120° ultrawide (Redmi 9T only); 2 MP f/2.4 macro; 2 MP f/2.4 depth |
| Rear features   | LED flash, HDR, panorama |
| Video           | 1080p @ 30 fps |
| Front camera    | 8 MP f/2.1 (wide) |
| Sensors / other | Side-mounted fingerprint, accelerometer, proximity, compass |
